er 進行策略性業務合併,並簽署最終協議,將 LNC 脂質奈米晶體平台與抗黴菌藥 **MAT2203** 出售給 Azurity。NYSE American 已接受公司的上市合規補救計畫,**合規期限至 2027 年 10 月 2 日**。\n\n**判讀備註:** 10/2 價位約 $2.42–2.75(未經一級源驗證)。無新消息的微型股盤後跳動,週一盤前報價可能完全不同。", "newsLinks": [{"label": "Finviz", "url": "https://finviz.com/quote.ashx?t=MTNB"}, {"label": "Yahoo Finance", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MTNB"}, {"label": "TradingView News", "url": "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/NASDAQ-MTNB/news/"}], "publishedAt": null, "publishedTimezone": "ET", "sources": [{"label": "StockTitan — MTNB 8-K material event", "url": "https://www.stocktitan.net/sec-filings/MTNB/8-k-matinas-bio-pharma-holdings-inc-reports-material-event-1402b553aff7.html"}], "seanAnalysis": null, "milanAnalysis": null, "sessions": [{"last": 2.87, "chgPct": 8.71, "volume": 217944, "session": "post", "direction": "up", "name": "Matinas Biopharma Hl", "sessionDate": "2026-10-02", "targetDate": "2026-10-05"}], "primarySession": "post", "primaryDirection": "up", "last": 2.87, "chgPct": 8.71, "volume": 217944, "tv": null, "shortFloat": 3.82, "shortRatio": 0.08, "marketCap_M": 2.59, "floatShares_M": 0.77, "perf1M": -5.38, "perf3M": -71.97, "perf6M": -67.8, "perfYTD": -69.97, "perf12M": -90.88, "prevOhlcv": null, "modelPred": {"version": "v12", "gap": 8.71, "predDay": 6.6, "band": [-6.6, 7.1], "tier": "small", "lottery": true, "spike": [2.4, 6.2, 10.9], "predHi": 15.5, "predHiBand": [11.3, 20.6]}, "modelPredScan": {"version": "v12", "gap": 8.71, "predDay": 6.6, "band": [-6.6, 7.1], "tier": "small", "lottery": true, "spike": [2.4, 6.2, 10.9], "predHi": 15.5, "predHiBand": [11.3, 20.6]}}, "RETO": {"symbol": "RETO", "name": "Reto Eco-Solutions Inc", "type": "news", "earningsReaction": false, "catalyst": "20 合 1 反向分割 10/2 生效(9/29 公告,為維持 Nasdaq 最低股價);流通股約 1.458 億→729 萬股,盤後 +34% 無其他消息", "newsDetail": "> **今日漲因:** **20 合 1 反向分割 10/2 生效**,目的是維持 Nasdaq 最低股價上市標準;正常盤 −16.7% 後盤後 **+34%**,查無其他消息。\n\n**事件詳解**\n\nReTo Eco-Solutions 於 **9 月 29 日 11:00 ET** 經 PRNewswire 公告 Class A 普通股 **20 合 1 合併**,10 月 2 日開盤起以分割後價格交易,代號不變、新 CUSIP 為 G75271158。流通股由約 **1.458 億股降至約 729 萬股**;不足一股的零股不發現金,直接進位補成一股。\n\n**背景**\n\n公司公告說明此舉是為了維持 Nasdaq 上市資格(最低股價規定),但新聞稿未載明收到缺失通知的日期。分割後流通股大幅縮小,盤後 +34% 屬低流通股的典型劇烈波動,沒有營運面的新消息支撐。\n\n**風險備註:** 反向分割後的小型股常見後續增發,屬客觀事實,公司本次公告未提及增資。", "newsLinks": [{"label": "Finviz", "url": "https://finviz.com/quote.ashx?t=RETO"}, {"label": "Yahoo Finance", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/RETO"}, {"label": "TradingView News", "url": "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/NASDAQ-RETO/news/"}], "publishedAt": "2026-09-29T11:00:00-04:00", "publishedTimezone": "ET", "sources": [{"label": "PRNewswire — ReTo announces share consolidation", "url": "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/reto-eco-solutions-inc-announces-share-consolidation-302892244.html", "publishedAt": "2026-09-29T11:00:00-04:00"}, {"label": "SEC 6-K exhibit 99.1", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/0001687277/000121390026055892/ea029037301ex99-1.htm"}], "seanAnalysis": null, "milanAnalysis": null, "sessions": [{"last": 2.08, "chgPct": 33.99, "volume": 4552420, "session": "post", "direction": "up", "name": "Reto Eco-Solutions Inc", "sessionDate": "2026-10-02", "targetDate": "2026-10-05"}], "primarySession": "post", "primaryDirection": "up", "last": 2.08, "chgPct": 33.99, "volume": 4552420, "tv": null, "shortFloat": 0.08, "shortRatio": 0, "marketCap_M": 13.7, "floatShares_M": 7.29, "perf1M": -93.75, "perf3M": -97.27, "perf6M": -97.55, "perfYTD": -98.99, "perf12M": -99.66, "prevOhlcv": null, "modelPred": {"version": "v12", "gap": 33.99, "predDay": 22.8, "band": [-6.6, 7.1], "tier": "small", "lottery": true, "spike": [7.8, 11.5, 16.2], "predHi": 49.4, "predHiBand": [44.4, 55.7]}, "modelPredScan": {"version": "v12", "gap": 33.99, "predDay": 22.8, "band": [-6.6, 7.1], "tier": "small", "lottery": true, "spike": [7.8, 11.5, 16.2], "predHi": 49.4, "predHiBand": [44.4, 55.7]}}, "NAUT": {"symbol": "NAUT", "name": "Nautilus Biotechnology Inc", "type": "analyst", "earningsReaction": false, "catalyst": "Nature Methods 論文(tau 蛋白異構體量化)+ 公布至 2028 年約 20 項檢測路線圖;Roth 首評買進 PT $3.50、Leerink 優於大盤 PT $4(9/9);盤後 +14%", "newsDetail": "> **今日漲因:** 10/2 **Nature Methods 刊出論文**,驗證 Nautilus 平台可量化約 **130 種 tau 蛋白異構體**,並公布至 2028 年中約 **20 項檢測**的產品路線圖;盤後再 **+14%**。\n\n**事件詳解**\n\n論文以公司的 Iterative Mapping 技術,對阿茲海默症相關的 tau 蛋白做單分子層級的異構體(proteoform)量化,約辨識 130 種型態。公司同時列出到 **2028 年中**約 20 項蛋白異構體檢測的開發路線,範圍包含帕金森氏症與腫瘤領域。\n\n**分析師**\n\nRoth Capital 首評**買進、目標價 $3.50**;Leerink Partners 首評**優於大盤、目標價 $4**(Leerink 首評日期為 9/9,非 10/2 當日)。\n\n**財務**\n\n第三方整理資料顯示現金約 **$8,400 萬**、單季淨損約 $1,450 萬(非一級源,僅供參考)。正常盤漲幅各來源不一(+12.7% 到 +24.8%),以實際報價為準。", "newsLinks": [{"label": "Finviz", "url": "https://finviz.com/quote.ashx?t=NAUT"}, {"label": "Yahoo Finance", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NAUT"}, {"label": "TradingView News", "url": "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/NASDAQ-NAUT/news/"}], "publishedAt": "2026-10-02T08:00:00-04:00", "publishedTimezone": "ET", "sources": [{"label": "StockTitan — Nature Methods publication", "url": "https://www.stocktitan.net/news/NAUT/nature-methods-publication-reveals-deep-insights-into-functional-0spw2se1tey1.html"}, {"label": "MarketBeat — Leerink initiates (9/9)", "url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/analyst-nautilus-biotechnology-nasdaq-naut-coverage-initiated-at-leerink-partners-2026-09-09/"}], "seanAnalysis": null, "milanAnalysis": null, "sessions": [{"last": 2.2305, "chgPct": 13.8, "volume": 2701399, "session": "post", "direction": "up", "name": "Nautilus Biotechnology Inc", "sessionDate": "2026-10-02", "targetDate": "2026-10-05"}], "primarySession": "post", "primaryDirection": "up", "last": 2.2305, "chgPct": 13.8, "volume": 2701399, "tv": null, "shortFloat": 5.53, "shortRatio": 2.57, "marketCap_M": 249.42, "floatShares_M": 73.83, "perf1M": 103.78, "perf3M": 13.95, "perf6M": -40.7, "perfYTD": 0.51, "perf12M": 125.52, "prevOhlcv": null, "modelPred": {"version": "v12", "gap": 13.8, "predDay": 14.1, "band": [-6.6, 7.1], "tier": "small", "lottery": false, "spike": [1.1, 4.8, 9.5], "predHi": 19.3, "predHiBand": [15.1, 24.6]}, "modelPredScan": {"version": "v12", "gap": 13.8, "predDay": 14.1, "band": [-6.6, 7.1], "tier": "small", "lottery": false, "spike": [1.1, 4.8, 9.5], "predHi": 19.3, "predHiBand": [15.1, 24.6]}}, "AMOD": {"symbol": "AMOD", "name": "Alpha Modus Holdings Inc", "type": "offering", "earningsReaction": false, "catalyst": "完成比特幣私募:發行約 5,162 萬股+同數權證換 3,170 枚 BTC,並恢復 Nasdaq 上市合規;盤前 +118%、量 4,200 萬股", "newsDetail": "> **今日漲因:** 10/1 宣布完成比特幣私募(PIPE),以 3,170 枚 BTC 換發新股與權證,淨值大增並恢復 Nasdaq 上市合規,盤前量爆約 4,200 萬股。\n\nAlpha Modus(AMOD)10/1 公告完成面向非美投資人的 PIPE:發行 **51,621,560** 股 A 類普通股及同數權證(履約價 **$4.36**),換得 **3,170 枚比特幣**,由新加坡子公司 AMOD Tech 持有。\n\n以 9/30 參考價約 **$83,612** 計,3,170 BTC 約值 **$2.65 億**(8/26 原公告以每枚 $71,000 計約 $2.25 億)。對照題述約 **$1,200 萬**的原市值,BTC 價值約為市值的 **20 倍以上**,但新股約 5,162 萬股也使股本大幅稀釋(外電稱約十倍稀釋),且權證日後行使還會再稀釋。\n\n公司表示股東權益已遠超 **$2 億**,解決 4 月收到的 Nasdaq 淨值最低 **$250 萬**不足通知,恢復上市合規。盤前約 **$2.56**(+118%),需留意新股解禁後的賣壓。", "newsLinks": [{"label": "Finviz", "url": "https://finviz.com/quote.ashx?t=AMOD"}, {"label": "Yahoo Finance", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMOD"}, {"label": "TradingView News", "url": "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/NASDAQ-AMOD/news/"}], "publishedAt": "2026-10-02T08:00:00-04:00", "publishedTimezone": "ET", "sources": [{"label": "Nasdaq/公司新聞稿", "url": "https://www.nasdaq.com/press-release/alpha-modus-advances-transaction-add-more-200-million-bitcoin-assets-its-balance", "publishedAt": "2026-10-01T12:00:00-04:00"}, {"label": "Investing.com: AMOD completes $250M bitcoin PIPE", "url": "https://in.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/alpha-modus-holdings-completes-250-million-bitcoin-pipe-transaction-regains-nasdaq-compliance-93CH-5615315", "publishedAt": "2026-10-01T12:00:00-04:00"}, {"label": "Benzinga: AMOD 盤後", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/equities/26/10/62126197/alpha-modus-holdings-shares-after-hours-bitcoin-private-placement", "publishedAt": "2026-10-01T12:00:00-04:00"}], "seanAnalysis": null, "milanAnalysis": null, "sessions": [{"last": 3.01, "chgPct": -13.78, "volume": 6159900, "session": "post", "direction": "down", "name": "Alpha Modus Holdings Inc", "sessionDate": "2026-10-02", "targetDate": "2026-10-05"}], "primarySession": "post", "primaryDirection": "down", "last": 3.01, "chgPct": -13.78, "volume": 6159900, "tv": {"latestEPS": -0.8, "consensusEPS": null, "priorYrEPS": null, "surpriseEPS_pct": null, "surpriseEPS_dollar": null, "latestRev_M": 0.0070999999999999995, "consensusRev_M": null, "priorYrRev_M": null, "surpriseRev_pct": null, "yrYrRev_pct": null, "epsYoY_pct": null, "epsEst_next4": [-1.6, -1.6, -1.6, -1.2], "revEst_next4": [0.0, 0.0, 0.8, 1.2], "yoyBlock": "N/M / N/M\n--------------------\nN/M / N/M\nN/M / N/M\nN/M / N/M\n-50.00% / +16801.41%", "chart": {"quarters": ["Q4 '25", "Q1 '26", "Q2 '26", "Q3 '26", "Q4 '26", "Q1 '27", "Q2 '27"], "eps_reported": [-0.8, null, null, null, null, null, null], "eps_estimate": [null, -1.6, -1.6, -1.6, -1.2, -1.6, -1.2], "rev_reported_M": [0.0070999999999999995, null, null, null, null, null, null], "rev_estimate_M": [null, 0.0, 0.0, 0.8, 1.2, 1.4, 2.2], "latest_idx": 0}, "latestReportDate": "2026-08-14", "nextReportDate": null}, "shortFloat": 6.6, "shortRatio": 0.09, "marketCap_M": 17.2, "floatShares_M": 0.54, "perf1M": 67.79, "perf3M": -17.1, "perf6M": -74.5, "perfYTD": -81.04, "perf12M": -92.21, "prevOhlcv": null, "modelPred": {"version": "v12", "gap": -13.78, "predDay": -13.6, "band": [-6.6, 7.1], "tier": "small", "lottery": true, "spike": [7.1, 10.9, 15.6], "predHi": -4.4, "predHiBand": [-7.7, -0.3]}, "modelPredScan": {"version": "v12", "gap": -13.78, "predDay": -13.6, "band": [-6.6, 7.1], "tier": "small", "lottery": true, "spike": [7.1, 10.9, 15.6], "predHi": -4.4, "predHiBand": [-7.7, -0.3]}}, "GLND": {"symbol": "GLND", "name": "Greenland Energy Company", "type": "momentum", "earningsReaction": false, "catalyst": "查無 10/2 新聞;正常盤 −15.2% 後盤後跌深反彈 +4.5%", "newsDetail": "> **今日漲因:** 美國、丹麥與格陵蘭9月簽署北極安全協議,格陵蘭資源類股全面走高;GLND自身雖無新公告,但先前對80 Mile plc提出的併購案仍在推進,兩項題材疊加推升股價。\n\n**事件詳解**\n\nGLND(Greenland Energy Company)是一家專注格陵蘭東部Jameson Land盆地的探勘階段公司,尚未進入生產。9月18日丹麥總理府宣布,格陵蘭、丹麥與美國預計簽署強化北極與北大西洋安全合作的協議,市場解讀此舉意在排除中國、俄羅斯等國參與格陵蘭稀土等資源開採,連帶炒熱格陵蘭資源概念股,GLND曾單日大漲逾**150%**。另一條主線是公司9月8日向英國上市公司80 Mile plc提出全股票併購意向,依英國併購法規Rule 2.4揭露的指示性條件:每1股80 Mile股份可換得**0.01108股**GLND普通股,以GLND股價1.37美元、匯率1英鎊兌1.35美元換算,80 Mile全部已發行股本估值約**6,148萬英鎊**,每股約1.1便士。目前僅為指示性條件,尚未提出正式要約。\n\n**公司與財務細節**\n\n公開資料顯示,GLND在8月25日至9月3日期間已於公開市場買進80 Mile約**2.47億股**,約當其已發行股本**4.42%**,均價介於0.53便士至0.82便士之間;依併購法規Rule 6.1(a),若正式提出要約,條件不得低於每股0.82便士(除非取得併購監理機構同意)。截至6月30日,GLND帳上現金約**3,740萬美元**、總資產約**6,760萬美元**、總負債僅**140萬美元**,市值約**6,000萬美元**,現金部位相對寬裕。\n\n**後續觀察點**\n\n併購案目前僅是指示性條件,能否轉為正式要約、80 Mile董事會的態度,以及格陵蘭安全協議後續細節是否牽動實際礦權開發進度,都是後續觀察重點。公司自身近期並無獨立於這兩項題材之外的營運面利多,漲勢主要仍是題材驅動,而非基本面出現實質改善。", "newsLinks": [{"label": "Finviz", "url": "https://finviz.com/quote.ashx?t=GLND"}, {"label": "Yahoo Finance", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GLND"}, {"label": "TradingView News", "url": "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/NASDAQ-GLND/news/"}], "publishedAt": "2026-09-21T10:49:00-04:00", "publishedTimezone": "ET", "sources": [{"label": "TipRanks — Greenland Energy proposes all-share merger with 80 Mile", "url": "https://www.tipranks.com/news/company-announcements/greenland-energy-proposes-all-share-merger-with-80-mile", "publishedAt": "2026-09-08T06:29:00-04:00"}, {"label": "StockTitan — Greenland Energy outlines £61m 80 Mile share deal (8-K filing summary)", "url": "https://www.stocktitan.net/sec-filings/GLND/8-k-greenland-energy-co-reports-material-event-7baac1565272.html", "publishedAt": "2026-09-08T00:00:00-04:00"}, {"label": "QuiverQuant — GLND stock soars as Greenland security pact and 80 Mile merger proposal draw traders", "url": "https://www.quiverquant.com/news/GLND+stock+soars+as+Greenland+security+pact+and+80+Mile+merger+proposal+draw+traders+to+the+name", "publishedAt": "2026-09-21T10:49:00-0